    "wipe"
   ]
  },
  "notes": {
   "walk": "in place, one 1.2 s cycle, about 1.0 m/s for adults (0.8 m/s for children)",
   "sit": "origin on the ground under the hips; seat top at 0.475 m (the square's benches); feet forward (+Z)",
   "mug": "the mug is the node 'mug', skinned to the bone 'mug'; clips without it scale that bone to 0",
   "lite": "lite files carry only what a lite figure plays (the lite market, and far people in the full market). Missing crowd clips fall back as site/src/crowd.js does: idle_free, chat_free and laugh play idle, walk_free plays walk, and the mug mesh stays hidden for *_free clips",
   "fallback": {
    "idle_free": "idle",
    "chat_free": "idle",
    "laugh": "idle",
    "walk_free": "walk"
   }
  }
 },
